Third-party material in the baud-wayland crate

The licence of baud-wayland is LICENSE. This file lists the material from
other projects that files in this crate carry: for each, the files by their
paths in this crate, the licence it keeps, and where the notice that licence
asks for is. It is generated from baud's record of third-party files, in its
repository at https://github.com/baud-terminal/baud, whose THIRD_PARTY.md
lists every such file there.

